                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "A hardcore retro platformer, with the emphasis on combat.\nThe jumping is very technical, but if u can combo long enough u get a shield, bigger jump radius, and a super move.  \nThe boss is bloody hard, but it would want to be, as the game only has 2 levels, normal and hard mode.\nFor a small indie game is well made and it took me 10 hours just to beat normal mode.\nI highly recommend it if your into retro hard games, and it often goes for a steal during a sale.\n\n3.5/5",
